sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SenderScreen
    participant EncryptionService
    participant Isolate as compute() isolate<br/>(runAesGcmEncrypt)
    participant PointyCastle as PointyCastle<br/>(FortunaRandom)

    Note over SenderScreen,PointyCastle: Invoked from within _encryptFile() - see SD005

    SenderScreen->>EncryptionService: encryptAesGcm(plaintext)
    EncryptionService->>PointyCastle: secureRandomBytes(32)
    PointyCastle-->>EncryptionService: key (256-bit AES key)
    EncryptionService->>PointyCastle: secureRandomBytes(12)
    PointyCastle-->>EncryptionService: iv (96-bit GCM nonce)

    EncryptionService->>Isolate: compute(runAesGcmEncrypt, [plaintext, key, iv])
    Note right of Isolate: GCMBlockCipher(AESEngine())<br/>..init(true, AEADParameters(<br/>KeyParameter(key), 128, iv, empty))
    Isolate-->>EncryptionService: ciphertext

    EncryptionService-->>SenderScreen: AesEncryptResult{ ciphertext, key, iv }
    Note right of SenderScreen: caller registers key / iv / ciphertext<br/>as wipeable buffers via registerBuffer()
